  "metadata": "Last modified on Feb 06, 2017",
  "content": "\n                    <p>The following algorithms are approved for use as specified in <a class=\"unresolved\" href=\"#\"><abbr title=\"Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers\">IEEE</abbr>\n                            1609.2-2016</a>:</p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><strong>Signing:</strong>&nbsp;<abbr title=\"Elliptic Curve Digital Signature Algorithm\">ECDSA</abbr> over NIST\n                            P-256</li>\n                        <li><strong>Public key encryption:</strong>&nbsp;<abbr title=\"Elliptic Curve Integrated Encryption Scheme\">ECIES</abbr> over\n                            <abbr title=\"National Institute of Standards and Technology\">NIST</abbr> P-256</li>\n                        <li><strong>Hash:</strong>&nbsp;SHA-256</li>\n                        <li><strong>Symmetric Encryption:&nbsp;</strong>AES-CCM with 128-bit keys</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>See IEEE 1609.2 for normative references to the definitions of the algorithms.</p>\n                ",
